 D1:{t:"3",h:"Immigrant first, IDP later",ex:"A foreign worker has lived in the country for ten years when an earthquake destroys his home and he moves to an evacuation site.",a:"IDP: nationality is irrelevant, his usual residence was where the event happened.",b:"International migrant (immigrant) from his earlier arrival, foreign-born foreign citizen. The move recorded is work, not displacement.",refs:"IRIS para 102 · IMTM paras 17, 25"},
